      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.4.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Your child proposes a cause or mechanism. Peri tests it with evidence questions, not hints."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.4.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Dein Kind schlägt eine Ursache oder einen Mechanismus vor. Peri überprüft es mit Beweis-Fragen, nicht mit Hinweisen.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.4.desc-2026-07-07T23:36:08.815260+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.4.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.5.desc-2026-07-07T23:36:08.815260+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-07T23:36:08.815260+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.5.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peri asks what this means for a new situation. Knowledge becomes portable."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.5.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peri fragt, was das für eine neue Situation bedeutet. Wissen wird tragbar.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.5.desc-2026-07-07T23:36:08.815260+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.5.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-2026-07-07T23:36:08.815260+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-07T23:36:08.815260+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.1.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "You\\'re at the creek bank. Before we measure anything — what\\'s the first thing you notice about the water right here versus ten feet upstream?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Du stehst am Creek-Ufer. Bevor wir irgendetwas messen — was fällt dir als Erstes an dem Wasser direkt hier im Vergleich zu zehn Metern flussaufwärts auf?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-2026-07-07T23:36:08.815260+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.1.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-2026-07-07T23:36:08.815260+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-07T23:36:08.815260+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.2.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "It\\'s slower here and there\\'s more mud on the bottom."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Es ist hier und da langsamer und es gibt mehr Schlamm am Boden.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-2026-07-07T23:36:08.815260+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.2.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-2026-07-07T23:36:30.947103+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-07T23:36:30.947103+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.3.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Good observation. Why do you think the mud settled here and not upstream where the water is faster?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Gute Beobachtung. Warum denkst du, dass sich der Schlamm hier abgelagert hat und nicht flussaufwärts, wo das Wasser schneller ist?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-2026-07-07T23:36:30.947103+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.3.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-2026-07-07T23:36:30.947103+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-07T23:36:30.947103+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.4.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Maybe slower water can\\'t carry as much stuff?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Kann langsameres Wasser nicht so viel tragen?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-2026-07-07T23:36:30.947103+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.4.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-2026-07-07T23:36:30.947103+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-07T23:36:30.947103+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.5.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "That\\'s the right direction. What could you measure or photograph here to support that idea?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Das ist die richtige Richtung. Was könntest du hier messen oder fotografieren, um diese Idee zu unterstützen?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-2026-07-07T23:36:30.947103+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.5.text"
      }
    },
